# Database Standards

- UUID PKs; FKs; unique constraints; indexes for tenant-scoped queries.
- DECIMAL for money (or documented integer satang); never float.
- created_at/updated_at; append-only audit tables.
- IMEI uniqueness and single active contract binding enforced.
- Migrations reviewed for tenant isolation impact.
